Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:07:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] fix(sidebar): keep worktree grouping in sync and visible
 in compact layout

- compare worktreeOf when deciding whether a project refresh changed
  anything, so a project whose parent resolves later is regrouped
- apply worktreeOf from session upserts to an already listed project
  (an omitted field leaves it unchanged)
- show a repository's worktree rows while any of them is expanded: the
  compact layout keeps one expanded project, so expanding a worktree
  used to collapse its repository and hide the worktree itself

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
